ing":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정도","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정도","audio":"/audio/88ae4fc4e7d9a56dbe66.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주고.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주고","audio":"/audio/c510b47c8539f2fdcb5a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"13e7ac62f574a294","term":"아이구","zh":"哎呀","audio":"/audio/13e7ac62f574a2947700.mp3","definition":"表示惊讶、感慨等的口语感叹；아이구 是 아이고 的口语变体。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"11cf51a3ca8b5108","term":"딸","zh":"女儿","audio":"/audio/11cf51a3ca8b5108ea09.mp3","entryId":"30210","definition":"由父母所生的子女中的女性；女性孩子。","pronunciation":["딸"]},{"id":"86f186a0317d70fc","term":"철","zh":"懂事，明理","audio":"/audio/86f186a0317d70fcbd94.mp3","entryId":"24952","definition":"能够辨别歪理或错误的想法的能力。","pronunciation"